Certora CLean
-------------

vendor/clean holds part of the export/ directory of Certora CLean
(https://github.com/Certora/clean), a Lean port of parts of CompCert: LEAN.md, LICENSE, CCLib.lean and the twenty modules of CCLib/ that
vendor/clean/README.md lists. vendor/clean/LICENSE is its license file, which lists export/
among the dual-licensed files. Each file we changed says so in its first line;
vendor/clean/README.md describes the changes and vendor/clean/upstream.json records the
revision and the hashes of the original files.

